flowchart TD
    A([openStrangles\nor maybeOpenStrangles]) --> B[AllInstruments from MarketData]
    B --> C[AccountEquity from Executor]
    C --> D[IVPercentile from DVOLTracker]
    D --> E[AllowedMargin = equity × IV band\n15% / 25% / 35%]
    E --> F[budget = allowed − marginUsed\nqtyPerDTE = quantize budget/numDTEs\nstep = max cfg.MinTA, inst.MinTradeAmount]

    F --> G{For each targetDTE\n10 · 15 · 30 · 45}
    G --> H[SelectExpiry\nnearest expiry in\ntargetDTE ± maxDTEDeviation\nprefer lowest DTE]
    H --> I{Expiry found?}
    I -->|"No"| J[Log skip\nnext DTE]
    I -->|"Yes"| K[SelectStrike CALL\nOTM: abs delta < 0.5\nMid > 0 required\nsort by abs-delta minus 0.16\npick closest to 0.16]
    K --> L[SelectStrike PUT\nsame OTM logic\nnegative delta side]
    L --> M{marginGuard\nWithinLimit?}
    M -->|"No"| J
    M -->|"Yes"| N[openStrangle\nre-quantize against\nexchange MinTradeAmount\nSubmit sell call limit\nSubmit sell put limit]
    N --> O{Both fills\nconfirmed?}
    O -->|"Yes"| P[activateStrangle\nAddPosition x2\nAddStrangle\nLog open both legs]
    O -->|"Pending"| Q[pendingStrangles map\nmonitor fill timeout\namend price on drift]
    J --> G
    P --> G
